main+='## 1. Executive Summary\n\n**Verdict: NOT PRODUCTION READY.** This is the supplied SparowVault repository, but it is a personal-finance product, not the complete SparowFinanceOS agency system described in the brief. The user explicitly approved auditing this repository against that brief. Missing agency modules are recorded as missing, not silently substituted with personal-finance analogues.\n\n';
main+=`The audit identified **${findings.length} findings: ${counts.Critical} Critical, ${counts.High} High, ${counts.Medium} Medium and ${counts.Low} Low**. The most serious are unsynced-data loss, duplicate concurrent mutations, partial sync commits, broken restore links, incomplete wipes, PIN/session failures and incorrect CA/report outputs. Severity totals count distinct findings once; dependency advisories and feature gaps are separate inventories.\n\nTypecheck/build/PHP syntax pass. The clean real unit run has **307 passing and 4 failing tests across 49 suites**. Core API tests pass 65/65, but custom probes reproduce failures those tests missed. Thirty routes were inspected at ten widths each with gated states identified. No honest finite audit can guarantee perfection or claim unexecuted combinations are covered.\n\n`;
main+='**Change boundary:** no application fixes, tracked source/config changes, commits, pushes, deployment, real database reset or real payment were performed during this audit. New reports/evidence and temporary test harnesses were created, the production build output was regenerated, and a disposable local audit database was used. Existing uncommitted user changes and historical reports were preserved.\n\nSupporting reports:\n\n'+reportLinks.map(p=>'- '+link('docs/'+p)).join('\n')+'\n\n';
